n.</p></div></div><div class="step"><b>04</b><div><h2>Understand each treatment</h2><p>Target → pathway → desired benefit → side-effect burden → measurable output.</p></div></div><div class="step"><b>05</b><div><h2>See both treatment paths</h2><p>Current medical treatment and ILMB routes are compared against the same required body outputs without inventing equivalence.</p></div></div><div class="step"><b>06</b><div><h2>When you want to save your journey</h2><p>The hospital creates your private patient record and gives you your own Patient ID and temporary password. You may then add a mobile/PIN later if you want easier repeat access.</p></div></div></div><div class="actions"><a href="/hospital.html">← Continue exploring hospital</a><a class="primary" href="/app/access.php">I already have patient access →</a></div></main></body></html>